==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Triumphant|Bronzong|15}} from the {{TCG|Triumphant}} expansion.
*'''Guard Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unleashed|Steelix|24}} from the {{TCG|Unleashed}} expansion.
